cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ORCA: Operational Risk & Cascade Analyzer"
message: "If you use ORCA in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Hiremath
    given-names: Prakul

repository-code: "https://github.com/prakulhiremath/ORCA"
license: Apache-2.0

keywords:
  - operational risk
  - portfolio risk
  - infrastructure risk
  - cloud outages
  - cyber incidents
  - supply chain disruptions
  - dependency graph
  - risk analytics
  - quantitative finance

abstract: >
  ORCA is an operational risk intelligence system that monitors
  real-world infrastructure events such as cloud outages, cyber incidents,
  and supply chain disruptions, maps them to company dependencies, and
  estimates portfolio exposure through graph-based risk propagation.

version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2025-03-01
